Cell["\<\
This solution is the starting condition (i.e. S[a,0]==Exp[-\[Lambda]0 a]) for \
t=0 for all future models. This is because we assume that FOI in the past was \
constant and the current conditions are now changing the FOI. For all models \
below t>0. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9405120186166873`*^9, 3.9405120883809676`*^9}, {
  3.9405121330552087`*^9, 3.9405121745371914`*^9}, {3.940512404929747*^9, 
  3.9405124139905005`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4c813fed-aa0e-411a-88f8-\
1d6e896bf260"]
}, Open  ]],

